      "text": "Each turn, by sibling mode\ntogether only: the first week all siblings ranked with a seat for EACH of them\nin their age group, or none of them\ntogether preferred: together if possible, otherwise one by one\nindependent (and single children): the highest-ranked week with a free seat",
